WEBVTT

00:08.931 --> 00:10.827
- ARE YOU READY, KIDS?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.931 --> 00:12.620
all: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
所有人：是，是，队长！

00:12.724 --> 00:14.103
- I CAN'T HEAR YOU.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:14.206 --> 00:15.896
all: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
所有人：是，是，队长！

00:16.000 --> 00:19.000
- ♪ OHH...
- ♪ 噢...

00:19.103 --> 00:21.172
♪ WHO LIVES IN A PINEAPPLE
UNDER THE SEA? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:21.275 --> 00:23.275
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:23.379 --> 00:25.206
- ♪ ABSORBENT AND YELLOW
AND POROUS IS HE ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:25.310 --> 00:27.000
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:27.103 --> 00:29.206
- ♪ IF NAUTICAL NONSENSE
BE SOMETHING YOU WISH ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你所希望的 ♪

00:29.310 --> 00:30.724
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:30.827 --> 00:33.172
- ♪ THEN DROP ON THE DECK
AND FLOP LIKE A FISH ♪
- ♪ 然后掉到甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:33.275 --> 00:35.137
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
- READY?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:35.241 --> 00:37.172
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:37.275 --> 00:39.068
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.172 --> 00:41.034
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
海绵宝宝！

00:41.137 --> 00:42.310
- SPONGEBOB
- 海绵宝宝

00:42.413 --> 00:44.586
SQUAREPANTS!
方裤！

00:44.689 --> 00:46.241
[laughing]
[笑]

00:46.344 --> 00:49.137
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

00:49.241 --> 00:50.103
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

01:05.827 --> 01:08.172
- WHAT BETTER WAY
OF SPENDING AN AFTERNOON
- 还有什么更好的方法
度过一个下午

01:08.275 --> 01:10.827
THAN TROLLING THE SEABED
FOR SPARE CHANGE.
比在海底拖钓
零钱。

01:10.931 --> 01:12.034
WHOO!
哇！

01:12.137 --> 01:13.793
[grunts]
[咕哝]

01:13.896 --> 01:15.137
[gasp]
[喘气]

01:15.241 --> 01:16.551
THERE'S GOTTA BE
A SMALL FORTUNE
一定有
一笔小财富

01:16.655 --> 01:20.241
IN DISCARDED PAPER CLIPS
IN THERE.
在废弃的回形针中
在那里。

01:20.344 --> 01:22.724
I KNEW THIS AREA
LOOKED FAMILIAR.
我了解这个领域
看起来很熟悉。

01:22.827 --> 01:24.206
WHAT'S THIS?
这是什么？

01:24.310 --> 01:26.379
WELL, THAT MUST BE
SANDY'S TREE DOME DWELLING.
嗯，那一定是
桑迪的树圆顶住宅。

01:26.482 --> 01:28.413
AND INSIDE IS WHAT LOOKS TO BE
THE MOST GINORMOUS SOYBEAN
里面就是看起来的样子
最大的大豆

01:28.517 --> 01:31.172
I EVER LAID ME
EYESTALKS ON.
我曾经让我上床
目光注视。

01:31.275 --> 01:32.517
HMM. NOW THIS BEARS GETTING
A CLOSER LOOK.
唔。现在这需要得到
仔细看看。

01:32.620 --> 01:34.620
[doorbell rings]
[门铃响]

01:34.724 --> 01:37.620
GOOD AFTERNOON, MS. SANDY.
下午好，女士。沙。

01:37.724 --> 01:39.896
- AND A GOOD AFTERNOON TO YOU,
MR. KRABS.
- 祝您下午好，
先生。螃蟹。

01:40.000 --> 01:42.517
WHAT BRINGS YOU OUT
TO THIS FINE NECK OF THE WOODS?
是什么让你脱颖而出
到这个美丽的脖子吗？

01:42.620 --> 01:43.724
- WELL, UH...
- 嗯，呃...

01:43.827 --> 01:45.758
I JUST HAPPENED TO BE
IN THE NEIGHBORHOOD
我只是碰巧是
在附近

01:45.862 --> 01:47.655
AND WAS WONDERING IF YOU COULD
SEE YOUR WAY CLEAR
想知道你是否可以
看清楚你的路

01:47.758 --> 01:50.103
TO GRACE ME WITH A
COMPREHENSIVE TOUR
给我一个恩典
综合游览

01:50.206 --> 01:52.379
OF YOUR HOME SWEET TREE DOME?
[chuckles]
您家的甜蜜树圆顶吗？
[笑声]

01:52.482 --> 01:55.172
I HEAR THE GIANT SOYBEANS ARE
LOVELY THIS TIME OF YEAR.
我听说巨型大豆是
每年的这个时候都很可爱。

01:55.275 --> 01:58.103
- SURE. LET'S GET YOU FITTED
WITH A HELMET.
- 当然。让我们帮您安装
带头盔。

01:58.206 --> 02:00.344
- DON'T BOTHER YOURSELF.
- 别打扰自己。

02:00.448 --> 02:01.758
AS LONG AS I KEEP
THE OLD LUNGS MOIST,
只要我坚持
老肺湿润，

02:01.862 --> 02:04.344
I CAN BREATHE YOUR FANCY AIR
ALL DAY LONG.
我可以呼吸你美妙的空气
一整天。

02:04.448 --> 02:07.379
- COME ON IN, THEN.
- 那么进来吧。

02:07.482 --> 02:10.862
- IT SEEMS SO MUCH BIGGER
ONCE YOU'RE INSIDE.
- 它看起来大得多
一旦你进去了。

02:10.965 --> 02:12.413
- THAT'S WHAT THEY ALL SAY.
- 他们都是这么说的。

02:12.517 --> 02:14.482
DID I ALREADY SHOW YOU MY
SINGLE-WHEELED ROLLER SKATES?
我已经向你展示过我的了吗？
单轮溜冰鞋？

02:14.586 --> 02:16.896
OR MY HELICOPTER THAT'S
POWERED BY COCONUT MILK?
或者我的直升机
由椰奶提供动力？

02:17.000 --> 02:19.620
- HUH? OH YEAH, THAT SOUNDS
INTERESTING, SANDY,
- 嗯？哦，是的，听起来不错
有趣的是，桑迪，

02:19.724 --> 02:21.000
BUT, UH, ACTUALLY--
但是，呃，实际上——

02:21.103 --> 02:22.379
- OR MY ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE
THAT COMES IN THE FORM
- 或者我的人工智能
形式如下

02:22.482 --> 02:24.896
OF A MULTICOLORED
CUBE-SHAPED PUZZLE?
多彩多姿的
立方体形状的拼图？

02:25.000 --> 02:25.896
SEE?
看？

02:26.000 --> 02:28.517
IT CAN SOLVE ITSELF.
它可以自行解决。

02:28.620 --> 02:29.827
- UH, SANDY,
- 呃，桑迪，

02:29.931 --> 02:32.448
ACTUALLY, I'M NOT REALLY
INTERESTED IN ALL THAT.
事实上，我并不是真的
对这一切都很感兴趣。

02:32.551 --> 02:35.379
- WELL, IS THERE SOMETHING
IN PARTICULAR YOU WANTED TO SEE?
- 嗯，有什么吗
您特别想看什么？

02:35.482 --> 02:38.655
- TELL ME ABOUT
YOUR GIANT SOYBEAN.
- 告诉我关于
你的巨型大豆。

02:38.758 --> 02:39.862
- THIS IS THE RESULT
- 这就是结果

02:39.965 --> 02:41.793
OF AN EXPERIMENTAL GROWTH SERUM
I DEVELOPED.
实验性生长血清
我开发了。

02:41.896 --> 02:43.448
IT COULD EASILY FEED
A LOT OF HUNGRY PEOPLE.
它可以轻松进食
很多饥饿的人。

02:43.551 --> 02:45.517
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

02:45.620 --> 02:47.310
OR SUPPLY AN ENTIRE
FAST FOOD RESTAURANT,
或提供整个
快餐店，

02:47.413 --> 02:48.344
LOWERING ITS OPERATING COSTS
降低运营成本

02:48.448 --> 02:50.413
AND INCREASING REVENUE
EXPONENTIALLY.
和增加收入
呈指数级增长。

02:50.517 --> 02:51.862
- ONCE THE TESTING
IS COMPLETE,
- 一旦测试
已完成，

02:51.965 --> 02:53.448
THE GROWTH SERUM COULD BE USED
TO DO A LOT OF GOOD THINGS.
可以使用生长精华
做很多好事。

02:53.551 --> 02:55.724
- [shrieks]
- [尖叫]

02:55.827 --> 02:57.689
- I SURE WOULD HATE TO SEE IT
FALL INTO THE WRONG HANDS.
- 我肯定不想看到它
落入坏人之手。

02:57.793 --> 02:58.689
SOMEONE WHO MIGHT JUST USE IT
TO TRY TO GET--
可能只是使用它的人
尝试获得——

02:58.793 --> 03:01.758
- RICH! I'LL BE RICH!
- 富有的！我会变得富有！

03:01.862 --> 03:03.724
- WHAT'S THAT, MR. KRABS?
-那是什么，先生。螃蟹？

03:03.827 --> 03:06.793
- UH, COULD I BORROW
YOUR TELEPHONE?
- 呃，我可以借用吗
你的电话？

03:06.896 --> 03:10.344
[keypad tone]
[键盘音]

03:10.448 --> 03:11.551
- [chuckles]
IT'S RINGING.
- [轻笑]
铃声响起。

03:11.655 --> 03:15.034
- MR. KRABS, I CAME
AS SOON AS I GOT THE CALL.
- 先生。蟹蟹我来了
我一接到电话。

03:15.137 --> 03:16.137
- UH...
- 呃...

03:16.241 --> 03:17.586
DID YOU BRING
A KRABBY PATTY
你带了吗
蟹肉饼

03:17.689 --> 03:19.379
LIKE I WAS PLANNING
TO ASK YOU TO DO?
就像我计划的那样
要求你做什么？

03:19.482 --> 03:20.793
- AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN.
- 是的，是的，队长。

03:20.896 --> 03:22.206
- PERFECT.
- 完美的。

03:22.310 --> 03:25.517
OKAY, SANDY.
ADMINISTER THE GROWTH SERUM.
好的，桑迪。
使用生长血清。

03:25.620 --> 03:27.379
- I DON'T KNOW, MR. KRABS.
- 我不知道，先生。螃蟹。

03:27.482 --> 03:29.172
I CAN'T PREDICT WHAT'S
GONNA HAPPEN.
我无法预测会发生什么
将会发生。

03:29.275 --> 03:32.172
- WELL, YOU DID SAY
IT NEEDS FURTHER TESTING.
- 嗯，你确实说过
需要进一步测试。

03:32.275 --> 03:33.965
TEST IT
ON THE KRABBY PATTY!
测试一下
在蟹肉饼上！

03:34.068 --> 03:35.827
- WELL...I SUPPOSE SO.
- 嗯...我想是这样。

03:35.931 --> 03:36.551
BUT ONLY A SINGLE DROP.
但只有一滴。

03:36.655 --> 03:42.586
- FAIR ENOUGH.
- 很公平。

03:42.689 --> 03:44.827
IS IT SUPPOSED
TO SMELL LIKE THAT?
是应该的吗
闻起来像那样吗？

03:44.931 --> 03:46.448
- IF YOU TWO WILL EXCUSE ME,
- 如果你们两个能原谅我的话

03:46.551 --> 03:48.689
I NEED TO PAY A QUICK VISIT TO
THE LITTLE SQUIRREL'S ROOM.
我需要快速访问
小松鼠的房间。

03:48.793 --> 03:50.724
WOULD YOU MIND HOLDING THESE
FOR ME WHILE I'M GONE?
您介意拿着这些吗
趁我不在的时候为我？

03:50.827 --> 03:53.241
I'LL ONLY BE A MINUTE.
我只需要一分钟。

03:53.344 --> 03:57.517
- OH, NO, WE DON'T MIND.
- 哦，不，我们不介意。

03:57.620 --> 03:59.517
[chuckles]
[笑声]

03:59.620 --> 04:00.724
THERE.
那里。

04:00.827 --> 04:05.379
- BUT SANDY SAID THAT--
- SH-SH-SH-SH.
- 但桑迪说--
-SH-SH-SH-SH。

04:05.482 --> 04:07.620
THANKS FOR THE TOUR, SANDY.
SEE YOU LATER.
感谢您的巡演，桑迪。
稍后见。

04:10.068 --> 04:12.482
EH, THAT PATTY DOESN'T LOOK LIKE
IT'S GROWING TO ME.
呃，那个小馅饼看起来不像
它对我来说正在成长。

04:12.586 --> 04:14.103
[scoffs]
GROWTH SERUM.
[嘲笑]
生长精华液。

04:14.206 --> 04:15.965
WASTE OF
A PERFECTLY GOOD KRABBY PATTY
浪费
完美的蟹肉饼

04:16.068 --> 04:16.965
IS WHAT THAT IS.
就是这样。

04:17.068 --> 04:17.931
- OH!
- 哦！

04:18.034 --> 04:19.379
MR. KRABS...
先生。螃蟹...

04:19.482 --> 04:22.206
- QUICK! LET'S GET IT
TO THE KRUSTY KRAB!
- 快的！让我们开始吧
到了脆皮蟹！

04:22.310 --> 04:25.620
- PATTY...BECOMING...AWKWARD.
- 帕蒂……变得……尴尬。

04:25.724 --> 04:26.793
- OH, HERE, HERE.
PUT IT IN THIS GROCERY BAG.
- 哦，这里，这里。
将其放入这个杂货袋中。

04:26.896 --> 04:28.344
- GROCERY BAG?
WHERE DID YOU GET A GROCERY BAG?
- 杂货袋？
您从哪里得到杂货袋？

04:28.448 --> 04:30.827
- THE GROCERY STORE.
- 杂货店。

04:39.241 --> 04:42.724
[door slams shut]
[门砰地关上]

04:42.827 --> 04:45.206
- SO, UH, HOW BIG IS THIS THING
SUPPOSED TO GET?
- 那么，呃，这东西有多大
应该得到吗？

04:45.310 --> 04:46.448
- [laughs]
WHO CARES?
- [笑]
谁关心？

04:46.551 --> 04:49.379
IT'S AN ENDLESS SUPPLY
OF FREE PATTIES!
源源不断
免费肉饼！

04:49.482 --> 04:52.896
AND COOK 'EM FAST, BOY.
WE'VE GOT CUSTOMERS.
快点煮吧，孩子。
我们有客户。

04:53.000 --> 04:54.241
- SPONGEBOB!
- 海绵宝宝！

04:54.344 --> 04:55.793
ARE YOU GONNA COOK THAT THING
你要煮那个东西吗

04:55.896 --> 04:57.206
OR JUST STAND THERE
STARING AT IT?
或者只是站在那里
盯着它？

04:57.310 --> 05:01.103
- SORRY, SQUIDWARD.
COMING RIGHT UP.
- 对不起，章鱼哥。
马上就来。

05:01.206 --> 05:02.413
ORDER UP, SQUIDWARD.
命令起来，章鱼哥。

05:02.517 --> 05:04.000
- ALL RIGHT,
KEEP 'EM COMING.
- 好吧，
让他们继续来。

05:04.103 --> 05:06.413
- YOU BETCHA.
- 你猜对了。

05:14.034 --> 05:15.379
OH, MY GOODNESS!
哦，我的天啊！

05:15.482 --> 05:17.655
I ALMOST FORGOT
TO FLIP THAT ONE.
我差点忘了
翻转那个。

05:17.758 --> 05:20.551
THERE WE GO.
我们开始了。

05:20.655 --> 05:22.758
- OKAY. THAT'S GREAT,
SPONGEBOB,
- 好的。太棒了，
海绵宝宝，

05:22.862 --> 05:24.931
BUT YOU DON'T HAVE TO
KNOCK ME IN THE--[screams]
但你不必这样做
敲我一下——[尖叫]

05:25.034 --> 05:26.275
- SQUIDWARD, WHY DID YOU MAKE
THAT WEIRD NOISE--
- 章鱼哥，你为什么这么做
那奇怪的声音——

05:26.379 --> 05:28.724
[screams]
[尖叫声]

05:28.827 --> 05:31.413
EASY, BOY, EASY.
简单，男孩，简单。

05:31.517 --> 05:32.758
I NEVER THOUGHT
I'D SAY THIS,
我从没想过
我想说的是，

05:32.862 --> 05:34.758
BUT I GOTTA GET OUT
OF THIS KITCHEN!
但我必须出去
这个厨房！

05:38.310 --> 05:40.655
[crying]
[哭泣]

05:40.758 --> 05:41.655
HUH?
嗯？

05:41.758 --> 05:46.655
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

05:46.758 --> 05:50.413
AH!
啊！

05:50.517 --> 05:53.344
SQUIDWARD, THAT GIANT
KRABBY PATTY IS ON A RAMPAGE!
章鱼哥，那个巨人
蟹蟹派蒂正在横冲直撞！

05:53.448 --> 05:54.586
WE HAVE TO ESCAPE.
我们必须逃跑。

05:54.689 --> 05:56.413
- DO YOU ALWAYS GO
BAREFOOT AT WORK,
- 你总是去吗
赤脚工作，

05:56.517 --> 05:57.862
OR HAVE I JUST NEVER
NOTICED BEFORE?
或者我从来没有
之前注意到了吗？

05:57.965 --> 05:58.827
- WOULDN'T THIS JUST COUNT
AS HALF-BAREFOOT?
- 这还不算吗
半赤脚？

05:58.931 --> 06:01.172
SQUIDWARD, BEHIND YOU!
章鱼哥，在你身后！

06:04.655 --> 06:07.241
ABANDON SHIP!
- [screams]
弃船！
- [尖叫]

06:07.344 --> 06:08.931
[customers screaming]
[顾客尖叫]

06:09.034 --> 06:11.000
- IT'S A KRABALANCHE!
- 这是克拉巴兰奇！

06:11.103 --> 06:12.689
- HOLD IT!
- 坚持住！

06:12.793 --> 06:14.862
AND JUST WHAT IS IT YOU TWO
THINK YOU'RE DOING?
你们两个到底是什么？
你觉得你在做什么吗？

06:14.965 --> 06:15.862
- THE RESTAURANT'S
BEING INVADED
- 餐厅的
被入侵

06:15.965 --> 06:18.655
BY A 300-FOOT
UNCOOKED MENU ITEM.
300 英尺
未煮熟的菜单项。

06:18.758 --> 06:19.896
WE'RE GETTING OUT OF HERE!
我们要离开这里了！

06:20.000 --> 06:22.586
- HO, HO.
THIS IS A DREAM COME TRUE.
- 何，何。
这是梦想成真。

06:22.689 --> 06:24.344
YOU CAN'T JUST LEAVE.
你不能就这样离开。

06:24.448 --> 06:25.965
- DO YOU HAVE A BETTER IDEA?
- 你有更好的主意吗？

06:26.068 --> 06:29.206
- STAY AND...WORK.
- 留下来...工作。

06:29.310 --> 06:31.862
OKAY.
YOU GO RIGHT AHEAD.
好的。
你就往前走吧。

06:31.965 --> 06:34.172
BUT I'D RATHER STAY ALIVE
THAN STAY AND WORK.
但我宁愿活下去
胜过留下来工作。

06:34.275 --> 06:36.206
NOW IF YOU--
现在如果你——

06:36.310 --> 06:38.275
[cash register rings]
[收银机铃声]

06:38.379 --> 06:40.448
- CASHIE!
- 收银！

06:40.551 --> 06:42.103
- MR. KRABS, LOOK OUT!
- 先生。螃蟹，小心！

06:42.206 --> 06:44.965
- AH!
[muffled yell]
- 啊！
[低声喊叫]

06:46.965 --> 06:49.689
[wood splintering]
[木头碎裂]

06:49.793 --> 06:51.206
- I THINK IT'S OUR BREAK TIME,
DON'T YOU?
- 我想现在是我们的休息时间
不是吗？

06:51.310 --> 06:57.172
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

07:04.551 --> 07:06.827
- WHAT'S THIS?
- 这是什么？

07:06.931 --> 07:09.275
KRABS IS COOKING UP
SOME NEW SCHEME
螃蟹正在烹饪
一些新方案

07:09.379 --> 07:12.034
TO UNDERMINE THE SUCCESS
OF HIS BIGGEST COMPETITOR,
破坏成功
他最大的竞争对手，

07:12.137 --> 07:13.068
ME?
我？

07:13.172 --> 07:17.000
I BETTER GET A CLOSER LOOK.
我最好仔细看看。

07:19.793 --> 07:21.965
OUTTA MY WAY, YOU BOOBS.
别挡我的路，你们这些胸部。

07:22.068 --> 07:23.862
- PLANKTON, YOU'RE GOING
THE WRONG WAY!
- 浮游生物，你走了
错误的方式！

07:23.965 --> 07:24.965
TURN BACK OR BE CRUSHED
BY A GIANT MONSTER!
回头或被压碎
来自一个巨大的怪物！

07:25.068 --> 07:27.482
- I CAN'T HEAR YOU!
- 我听不到你说话！

07:27.586 --> 07:28.344
I NEED TO SEE THIS.
我需要看看这个。

07:28.448 --> 07:30.000
OH!
哦！

07:30.103 --> 07:33.655
HOLY MOTHER OF ALL CREATURES
GREAT AND SMALL...
万物之母
大大小小的...

07:35.379 --> 07:39.862
IT'S THE LARGEST KRABBY PATTY
THE WORLD HAS EVER SEEN.
这是最大的蟹肉饼
世界前所未见。

07:39.965 --> 07:42.206
IT'S...IT'S...
这是……这是……

07:42.310 --> 07:43.793
GORGEOUS.
华丽的。

07:43.896 --> 07:46.241
OH, GREAT PATTY!
TAKE ME!
哦，伟大的帕蒂！
带我去！

07:46.344 --> 07:50.000
TAKE ME HOME, DADDY!
带我回家吧，爸爸！

07:51.034 --> 07:56.862
[crowd screams]
[人群尖叫]

07:56.965 --> 07:58.965
- KEEP RUNNING!
IT'S GETTING CLOSER!
- 继续跑！
越来越近了！

07:59.068 --> 08:00.000
- NO, IT ISN'T!
- 不，不是！

08:00.103 --> 08:02.620
LOOK WHERE I'M POINTING.
IT STOPPED.
看我指的地方。
它停了。

08:02.724 --> 08:04.827
- HEY, HE'S RIGHT.
- 嘿，他是对的。

08:10.034 --> 08:12.241
[screaming]
[尖叫]

08:24.000 --> 08:26.965
- [belches]
- [打嗝]

08:35.793 --> 08:37.172
- SNOOKUMS, LOOK OUT!
- 斯努库姆斯，小心！

08:37.275 --> 08:39.862
YOU'VE GOT TO PROMISE MOMMY
YOU'LL BE MORE CAREFUL.
你必须答应妈妈
你会更加小心。

08:39.965 --> 08:41.517
NEPTUNE KNOWS WHAT SHE'D DO
海王星知道她会做什么

08:41.620 --> 08:43.517
IF YOU WERE SWALLOWED
BY THE PUTRID OOZE
如果您被吞下
在腐烂的软泥旁

08:43.620 --> 08:46.137
THAT'S RUNNING RAMPANT
IN OUR STREETS.
这正在猖獗
在我们的街道上。

08:50.655 --> 08:52.724
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

08:52.827 --> 08:54.068
- GARY, GARY! WAKE UP!
- 加里，加里！醒来吧！

08:54.172 --> 08:55.551
PACK YOUR STUFF!
收拾好你的东西！

08:55.655 --> 08:56.724
OUR HOUSE IS ABOUT TO BE
我们的房子即将建成

08:56.827 --> 09:00.034
KNOCKED OVER BY
A GIANT KRABBY PATTY!
被撞倒
巨型蟹肉饼！

09:00.137 --> 09:04.586
- [yawns and snores]
- [打哈欠和打鼾]

09:04.689 --> 09:07.344
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

09:12.000 --> 09:14.103
WAKE UP, PATRICK!
WE GOTTA GET OUT OF HERE!
醒来，帕特里克！
我们必须离开这里！

09:14.206 --> 09:18.724
- AH. HI, SPONGEBOB.
I JUST HAD THE STRANGEST DREAM.
- 啊。嗨，海绵宝宝。
我刚刚做了一个最奇怪的梦。

09:18.827 --> 09:20.413
I WAS BEING CHASED
DOWN THE STREET
我被追赶
沿着街道

09:20.517 --> 09:21.620
BY A GIANT KRABBY PATTY.
由巨型蟹肉饼制作。

09:21.724 --> 09:22.586
- THAT WASN'T A DREAM!
- 那不是梦！

09:22.689 --> 09:24.931
both: AH!
两人：啊！

09:28.379 --> 09:30.206
- SAY, SPONGEBOB,
WHAT ARE WE GOING TO DO?
- 说吧，海绵宝宝，
我们要做什么？

09:30.310 --> 09:33.758
- WE'RE GOING TO FIND SANDY.
SHE'LL KNOW WHAT TO DO.
- 我们要找到桑迪。
她会知道该怎么做。

09:33.862 --> 09:35.000
- I DON'T THINK SHE'S HOME,
SPONGEBOB.
- 我想她不在家
海绵宝宝。

09:35.103 --> 09:36.103
- SHE HAS TO BE.
THIS IS HER TREE DOME.
- 她必须是。
这是她的树顶。

09:36.206 --> 09:39.000
SANDY, WHERE ARE YOU?
桑迪，你在哪里？

09:39.103 --> 09:41.275
- SPONGEBOB?
- 海绵宝宝？

09:41.379 --> 09:42.620
- SANDY?
- 桑迪？

09:42.724 --> 09:44.689
- NO, SPONGEBOB.
UP HERE.
- 不，海绵宝宝。
在这里。

09:44.793 --> 09:45.793
[helicopter whirling]
AND HURRY.
【直升机盘旋】
快点。

09:45.896 --> 09:48.482
I'M RUNNING
OUT OF COCONUT MILK.
我在跑步
没有椰奶了。

09:48.586 --> 09:49.827
- WOW, WHAT HAPPENED
TO YOUR TREE DOME?
- 哇，发生了什么事
去你的树顶吗？

09:49.931 --> 09:51.758
- WELL, THAT GIANT SOYBEAN
GOT TOO BIG,
- 嗯，那个巨大的大豆
太大了，

09:51.862 --> 09:53.827
SO I CHOPPED IT UP AND TURNED IT
INTO A GIANT SALAD.
所以我把它切碎然后翻过来
变成一份巨大的沙拉。

09:53.931 --> 09:56.827
ANYBODY GOT
ANY GIANT CROUTONS?
任何人都有
有巨型油煎面包块吗？

09:56.931 --> 09:58.793
- I THINK I'M GOING TO BE SICK.
- 我想我要生病了。

09:58.896 --> 10:01.103
- WHAT'S THE MATTER, PATRICK?
AIR SICKNESS?
- 出什么事了，帕特里克？
晕机？

10:01.206 --> 10:02.482
- NO.
- 不。

10:02.586 --> 10:06.000
THE THOUGHT OF A SALAD THAT SIZE
IS MORE THAN I CAN HANDLE.
这么大的沙拉的想法
超出了我的承受能力。

10:06.103 --> 10:07.793
- AND NOW THAT
I MASTERED THE SOYBEAN,
- 现在
我掌握了大豆，

10:07.896 --> 10:09.482
I CAN MASTER THAT PATTY.
我能掌握那个小馅饼。

10:09.586 --> 10:10.689
- REALLY? HOW?
- 真的吗？如何？

10:10.793 --> 10:12.034
- THE PUZZLE CUBE TOLD ME
- 拼图立方体告诉我的

10:12.137 --> 10:15.827
THE KEY TO DEFEATING THE PATTY
IS YOU, SPONGEBOB.
击败肉饼的关键
是你吗，海绵宝宝。

10:15.931 --> 10:18.724
ALL I HAVE TO DO IS GET YOU
CLOSE ENOUGH TO IT,
我所要做的就是得到你
足够接近它，

10:18.827 --> 10:19.793
SO YOU CAN MAKE
DIRECT CONTACT.
所以你可以做
直接联系。

10:19.896 --> 10:21.793
- DIRECT CONTACT?
ARE YOU SURE?
- 直接联系？
你确定吗？

10:21.896 --> 10:24.034
- THE PUZZLE CUBE
NEVER LIES.
- 拼图立方体
从不说谎。

10:25.413 --> 10:27.965
OKAY, WE HAVE A VISUAL.
好的，我们有一个愿景。

10:28.068 --> 10:29.793
PUTTING YOU INTO POSITION,
SPONGEBOB.
让您就位，
海绵宝宝。

10:34.655 --> 10:36.482
- MM-KAY.
BYE.
- MM-凯。
再见。

10:36.586 --> 10:37.965
WELL, GIANT PATTY.
[gulps]
好吧，巨人帕蒂。
[吞咽]

10:38.068 --> 10:41.172
I GUESS IT'S JUST YOU AND ME.
我想只有你和我。

10:41.275 --> 10:42.241
WAIT, WHAT WAS I SUPPOSED
TO DO AGAIN?
等等，我本来应该做什么
再来一次？

10:42.344 --> 10:45.448
- JUST MAKE DIRECT CONTACT.
- 只需直接联系即可。

10:45.551 --> 10:50.034
- DIRECT CONTACT.
YOU MEAN LIKE THIS?
- 直接联系。
你的意思是这样吗？

10:50.137 --> 10:51.103
- IT'S WORKING.
- 它正在工作。

10:51.206 --> 10:54.241
KEEP GOING, SPONGEBOB.
YOU CAN DO IT.
继续前进，海绵宝宝。
你可以做到。

10:54.344 --> 10:58.241
- OH, MY BODY...FILLING
WITH KRABBY PATTY...
- 哦，我的身体...充满
与蟹肉饼一起...

10:58.344 --> 11:03.137
ENORMOUS PAIN.
巨大的痛苦。

11:03.241 --> 11:05.689
NEVER ABSORBED
THIS MUCH KRABBY PATTY
从未被吸收
这么多蟹肉饼

11:05.793 --> 11:07.896
INTO MY BODY BEFORE!
进入我的身体之前！

11:08.000 --> 11:10.206
IN FACT, NEVER ABSORBED ANY
KRABBY PATTIES
事实上，从未吸收过任何
蟹肉饼

11:10.310 --> 11:12.206
INTO MY BODY,
COME TO THINK OF IT.
进入我的身体，
想一想。

11:21.551 --> 11:24.827
OKAY.
WHAT DO I DO NOW?
好的。
我现在该怎么办？

11:24.931 --> 11:26.103
- STEP RIGHT UP, FOLKS!
- 伙计们，站起来！

11:26.206 --> 11:29.620
FOR A LIMITED TIME,
PRE-ABSORBED KRABBY PATTIES.
在有限的时间内，
预吸收的蟹肉饼。

11:29.724 --> 11:30.724
[cash register rings]
[收银机铃声]

11:30.827 --> 11:34.172
- SPONGEBOB.
TWO. MEDIUM RARE.
- 海绵宝宝。
二。三分熟。

11:34.275 --> 11:35.000
- COPY THAT.
OVER.
- 复制那个。
超过。

11:35.103 --> 11:36.137
- THAT'S IT,
DON'T CROWD.
- 就是这样，
不要拥挤。

11:36.241 --> 11:37.965
WHILE SUPPLIES LAST.
DON'T BE SHY.
售完即止。
不要害羞。

11:38.068 --> 11:44.379
COME ON.
快点。

11:44.482 --> 11:45.862
[laughter]
[笑声]

12:12.275 --> 12:14.103
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

12:14.206 --> 12:17.137
HEY, YOU STUPID BUBBLE,
I JUST WASHED THOSE.
嘿，你这个愚蠢的泡泡，
我刚刚洗了那些。

12:19.896 --> 12:20.896
- OH!
- 哦！

12:22.448 --> 12:24.344
- AH, MY SPINE!
- 啊，我的脊椎！

12:24.448 --> 12:25.931
- WHY DON'T YOU WATCH
WHERE YOU'RE GOING?
- 你为什么不看
你要去哪里？

12:26.034 --> 12:27.000
- COME BACK HERE!
- I'LL SUE!
- 回到这里！
- 我要起诉！

12:30.310 --> 12:32.206
- [slurps]
- [啜饮]

12:32.310 --> 12:34.344
[gargling]
[漱口]

12:43.862 --> 12:44.827
- AH--
-啊--

12:44.931 --> 12:48.172
[gulps]
[吞咽]

12:48.275 --> 12:50.241
HEY, LITTLE BUBBLE.
WHERE'D YOU COME FROM?
嘿，小泡泡。
你从哪里来？

12:50.344 --> 12:52.758
PERHAPS THIS LETTER WILL SHED
SOME LIGHT ON YOUR ORIGIN.
也许这封信会被遗弃
关于你的起源的一些线索。

12:52.862 --> 12:54.620
IT'S FROM MY OLD FRIEND,
BUBBLE BUDDY.
这是我的老朋友发来的，
泡泡好友。

12:54.724 --> 12:57.482
WONDER WHAT'S UP WITH HIM?
想知道他怎么了？

12:57.586 --> 12:58.310
LET'S SEE NOW.
现在让我们看看。

12:58.413 --> 13:00.551
"DEAR SPONGEBOB,
“亲爱的海绵宝宝，

13:00.655 --> 13:03.448
THE MISSUS AND I HAVE TO
GO AWAY FOR A FEW DAYS.
夫人和我必须
离开几天。

13:03.551 --> 13:05.344
AND OUR REGULAR BUBBLE SITTER
IS SICK.
和我们的常规泡泡保姆
生病了。

13:05.448 --> 13:09.482
COULD YOU PLEASE WATCH OUR SON
SHINY UNTIL WE GET BACK?
你能照顾一下我们的儿子吗
闪亮直到我们回来？

13:09.586 --> 13:12.896
I OWE YOU ONE.
YOUR PAL, BUBBLE BUDDY.
我欠你一个。
你的朋友，泡泡伙伴。

13:13.000 --> 13:15.137
PLEASE KEEP SHINY AWAY
FROM SHARP OBJECTS.
请保持闪亮远离
来自尖锐物体。

13:15.241 --> 13:18.965
WE DON'T WANT HIM TO GO POP
LIKE HIS LATE UNCLE RAYMOND."
我们不想让他流行
就像他已故的叔叔雷蒙德一样。”

13:19.068 --> 13:22.137
OH, BOY!
DID YOU HEAR THAT, GARY?
哦，男孩！
你听到了吗，加里？

13:22.241 --> 13:24.827
- THEY WANT ME
TO WATCH LITTLE SHINY.
- 他们想要我
观看小闪亮。

13:24.931 --> 13:26.551
GEE, I WONDER WHEN
HE'S GOING TO SHOW UP.
哎呀，我想知道什么时候
他会出现的。

13:26.655 --> 13:28.241
THE LETTER DOESN'T SAY.
信中没有说。

13:28.344 --> 13:29.482
I CAN'T WAIT TO MEET HIM.
我迫不及待地想见他。

13:29.586 --> 13:31.000
OH!
哦！

13:31.103 --> 13:32.310
OH, HEY.
THERE YOU ARE, SHINY.
哦，嘿。
你就在那里，闪亮的。

13:32.413 --> 13:34.137
LOOK AT YOU.
看看你。

13:34.241 --> 13:34.965
YOU ARE JUST AS CUTE
AS THE DICKENS.
你也一样可爱
正如狄更斯。

13:35.068 --> 13:36.689
UPSY-DAISY!
UPSY-雏菊！

13:36.793 --> 13:40.103
SAY HELLO TO SHINY, GARY.
向闪亮的加里问好。

13:40.206 --> 13:41.827
[yowls and hisses]
[嚎叫声和嘶嘶声]

13:41.931 --> 13:42.827
- OH, YOU'RE FULL OF
SOAP AND VINEGAR,
- 哦，你充满了
肥皂和醋，

13:42.931 --> 13:43.896
AREN'T YOU?
你不是吗？

13:44.000 --> 13:44.827
I CAN'T WAIT
FOR ALL MY FRIENDS
我等不及了
为了我所有的朋友

13:44.931 --> 13:48.000
TO MEET YOU.
遇见你。

13:48.103 --> 13:50.413
♪ LA LA LA LA
LA LA LA LA LA ♪
♪ 啦啦啦啦
啦啦啦啦啦♪

13:50.517 --> 13:51.965
- THIS IS GOING TO BE GREAT,
SHINY BUBBLE.
- 这会很棒，
闪亮的泡泡。

13:52.068 --> 13:54.448
WHOOP,
DOWNSIE DAFFODIL.
哎呀，
唐西水仙花。

13:54.551 --> 13:55.275
SQUIDWARD LOVES
MEETING MY FRIENDS.
章鱼哥最爱
会见我的朋友。

13:55.379 --> 13:58.034
- NO, I DON'T.
- 不，我不。

13:58.137 --> 13:58.655
- YOU'RE GOING
TO LIKE SQUIDWARD.
- 你要走了
喜欢《章鱼哥》。

13:58.758 --> 14:01.689
HE'S LOTS OF FUN.
他很有趣。

14:01.793 --> 14:04.758
SO HOW WAS YOUR TRIP?
那么您的旅行怎么样？

14:04.862 --> 14:05.827
YOU DON'T TALK MUCH, DO YOU?
你话不多，是吗？

14:05.931 --> 14:07.241
HMM.
GUESS HE'S NOT HOME.
唔。
我猜他不在家。

14:07.344 --> 14:09.310
OH, WELL.
WE CAN TRY AGAIN LATER.
那好吧。
我们可以稍后再试。

14:09.413 --> 14:11.862
WAIT, SHINY!
WHERE ARE YOU GOING?
等等，闪亮！
你要去哪里？

14:11.965 --> 14:14.000
YOU CAN'T GO IN THERE.
YOU WEREN'T INVITED.
你不能进去那里。
你没有被邀请。

14:14.103 --> 14:18.931
[glass shattering]
[玻璃破碎]

14:19.034 --> 14:21.137
- WOULD YOU PLEASE
GET YOUR FRIEND
- 可以吗
找你的朋友

14:21.241 --> 14:23.137
OUT OF MY HOUSE?
离开我的房子？

14:28.793 --> 14:29.758
- WHERE'D HE GO?
- 他去哪儿了？

14:29.862 --> 14:31.137
- SQUIDWARD!
- 章鱼哥！

14:31.241 --> 14:33.413
THIS ROOM IS SO FULL
OF SHARP, JAGGED, BROKEN THINGS.
这个房间已经满了
尖锐、锯齿状、破碎的东西。

14:33.517 --> 14:36.206
THIS IS NO PLACE FOR A
DELICATE LITTLE BUBBLE BOY.
这里不适合
精致的小泡泡男孩。

14:36.310 --> 14:38.379
[gasps]
THERE HE IS!
[喘气]
他就在那里！

14:38.482 --> 14:40.965
DON'T WORRY.
I'LL SAVE HIM.
不用担心。
我会救他。

14:41.068 --> 14:42.896
NOPE.
没有。

14:43.000 --> 14:44.034
JAGGED GLASS.
锯齿状玻璃。

14:44.137 --> 14:45.413
BARBED WIRE.
铁丝网。

14:45.517 --> 14:46.896
CACTUSES.
仙人掌。

14:47.000 --> 14:49.344
CACTUSES PROTECTED
BY BARBED WIRE.
仙人掌受保护
通过铁丝网。

14:49.448 --> 14:50.551
SHH.
嘘。

14:50.655 --> 14:53.275
SHINY MUST BE IN THIS ONE.
闪亮的一定在这一款中。

14:53.379 --> 14:54.931
GOTCHA!
明白了！

14:55.034 --> 14:56.620
NO, GUESS NOT.
不，我猜不是。

14:56.724 --> 14:57.965
OH NO!
哦不！

14:58.068 --> 14:59.655
YOU DON'T THINK HE
P-P-P-POPPED IN THERE?
你不认为他
啪-啪-啪-突然出现在那里？

14:59.758 --> 15:01.068
- THERE HE IS.
- 他就在那里。

15:01.172 --> 15:03.137
HE'S HEADED RIGHT
FOR MY GLASS MENAGERIE.
他的方向是正确的
为了我的玻璃动物园。

15:08.517 --> 15:11.517
WHEW!
哇！

15:11.620 --> 15:13.827
- HOLD STILL, SHINY.
I'LL GET YOU DOWN.
- 保持不动，闪亮。
我会把你打倒的。

15:13.931 --> 15:18.103
GOTCHA!
[screams]
明白了！
[尖叫声]

15:18.206 --> 15:19.103
[glass shattering]
[玻璃破碎]

15:19.206 --> 15:21.931
- OF COURSE.
- 当然。

15:22.034 --> 15:23.275
- OKAY, SHINY.
FUN IS FUN.
- 好的，闪亮的。
有趣就是有趣。

15:23.379 --> 15:25.068
BUT IT'S TIME
TO COME DOWN NOW.
但现在是时候了
现在就下来。

15:25.172 --> 15:27.586
UGH, BARNACLES.
呃，藤壶。

15:27.689 --> 15:32.793
AH! OH, NO!
啊！哦，不！

15:32.896 --> 15:35.689
SHINY, COME BACK.
闪亮，回来吧。

15:35.793 --> 15:36.793
THERE HE IS.
他就在那里。

15:40.172 --> 15:41.862
HE'S HEADED
FOR THAT OPEN WINDOW.
他头球了
为了那扇打开的窗户。

15:48.068 --> 15:50.896
I GOT YA, YOU LITTLE RASCAL.
我抓住你了，你这个小流氓。

15:51.000 --> 15:52.551
IT LOOKS LIKE SHINY WANTS
TO BE AN ARTIST,
看起来像闪亮的想要
成为一名艺术家，

15:52.655 --> 15:54.137
JUST LIKE YOU.
就像你一样。

15:54.241 --> 15:57.620
- SPONGEBOB, I SPENT SIX LONG
MONTHS ON THAT PAINTING.
- 海绵宝宝，我花了六年时间
那幅画的几个月。

15:57.724 --> 15:59.862
- DON'T WORRY, SQUIDWARD.
SHINY'S MADE OF SOAP.
- 别担心，章鱼哥。
闪亮的是肥皂制成的。

15:59.965 --> 16:02.379
WE'LL JUST WASH IT OFF.
我们就把它洗掉。

16:02.482 --> 16:08.206
THERE YOU GO.
GOOD AS NEW.
就这样吧。
完好如新。

16:08.310 --> 16:09.620
- [growling]
- [咆哮]

16:09.724 --> 16:11.379
REALLY CAPTURES
YOUR INNER SELF.
真正捕捉到
你的内在自我。

16:11.482 --> 16:13.758
OH MY, LOOK AT THAT.
TIME TO GO TO WORK.
天啊，看看那个。
是时候去上班了。

16:13.862 --> 16:14.586
SEE YOU THERE.
BYE.
到时见。
再见。

16:14.689 --> 16:17.413
[groaning angrily]
[愤怒地呻吟]

16:18.965 --> 16:20.310
HI, MR. KRABS.
嗨，先生。螃蟹。

16:20.413 --> 16:21.482
- MORNIN', LADDIE.
- 早上好，莱迪。

16:21.586 --> 16:22.758
WHAT'S WITH THE GLASS PUPPET?
玻璃木偶怎么了？

16:22.862 --> 16:24.896
- HE'S NOT GLASS, MR. KRABS.
- 他不是玻璃，先生。螃蟹。

16:25.000 --> 16:26.034
REMEMBER BUBBLE BUDDY?
还记得泡泡好友吗？

16:26.137 --> 16:28.275
WELL, I'M TAKING CARE
OF HIS SON.
嗯，我会照顾的
他儿子的。

16:28.379 --> 16:31.724
- BUBBLE BUDDY, EH?
THAT GUY STILL OWES ME MONEY.
- 泡泡伙伴，嗯？
那家伙还欠我钱。

16:31.827 --> 16:34.275
SO, WHAT'S
THE LITTLE DEADBEAT'S NAME?
那么，什么是
小赖子的名字？

16:34.379 --> 16:37.000
ALLOW ME TO INTRODUCE
SHINY BUBBLE.
请允许我介绍一下
闪亮的泡泡。

16:37.103 --> 16:39.034
[whispering]
HE DOESN'T TALK MUCH.
[窃窃私语]
他话不多。

16:39.137 --> 16:40.931
SHAKE HANDS WITH MR. KRABS,
SHINY.
与先生握手螃蟹，
闪亮的。

16:41.034 --> 16:42.482
- PUT HER THERE, LAD.
- 把她放那儿，小伙子。

16:42.586 --> 16:43.827
HEY!
嘿！

16:43.931 --> 16:45.379
- OOH!
- 哦！

16:45.482 --> 16:46.241
YOU MIGHT WANT TO BE CAREFUL
WITH THOSE CLAWS, MR. KRABS.
你可能要小心
有了那些爪子，先生。螃蟹。

16:50.689 --> 16:52.758
- HOLD STILL,
YOU LITTLE RASCAL!
- 保持不动，
你这个小流氓！

16:52.862 --> 16:54.896
- DON'T WORRY, I'VE GOT HIM.
- 别担心，我找到他了。

16:55.000 --> 16:55.965
WOW, MR. KRABS.
哇，先生。螃蟹。

16:56.068 --> 16:58.482
LOOK HOW SHINY
SHINY MADE YOU.
看看多闪亮
闪亮成就了你。

16:58.586 --> 17:00.137
- WOO-HOO NOW,
LOOK AT THAT.
- 现在呜呼，
看看那个。

17:00.241 --> 17:02.620
I'VE NEVER FELT
THIS CLEAN ON A WEEKDAY.
我从来没有感觉到
工作日这么干净。

17:02.724 --> 17:04.482
WHY DON'T YOU TAKE SHINY THERE
INTO THE KITCHEN,
你为什么不带闪亮去那里
走进厨房，

17:04.586 --> 17:06.310
AND LET HIM PLAY AROUND
WITH THE DIRTY DISHES?
让他玩
脏盘子？

17:06.413 --> 17:10.206
- WOW, I THINK MR. KRABS
REALLY LIKES YOU.
- 哇，我想先生。蟹蟹
真的很喜欢你。

17:10.310 --> 17:14.517
NOW YOU PLAY WITH THESE
WHILE I TEND TO THE GRILL.
现在你玩这些
当我去烧烤的时候。

17:14.620 --> 17:16.241
YOU SURE ARE LUCKY, SHINY.
你确实很幸运，很闪亮。

17:16.344 --> 17:18.172
YOU GET TO LEARN
ALL ABOUT THE GLORIES
你要学习
关于荣耀的一切

17:18.275 --> 17:20.000
OF THE SERVICE INDUSTRY.
服务业的。

17:23.000 --> 17:24.310
YESSIREE, SHINER.
是的，闪亮的。

17:24.413 --> 17:26.034
YOU SHOW ME A SIZZLIN' GRILL,
你给我看了一个铁板烤架，

17:26.137 --> 17:27.620
AND I WILL SHOW YOU
A HAPPY CUSTOMER.
我会告诉你
一个快乐的客户。

17:29.586 --> 17:30.482
- WHOA!
- 哇！

17:30.586 --> 17:32.172
- WHOA!
- 哇！

17:32.275 --> 17:34.344
- WHOA!
- 哇！

17:34.448 --> 17:35.965
[grunts]
HERNIA.
[咕哝]
疝气。

17:37.344 --> 17:38.689
[clang]
[铛]

17:38.793 --> 17:43.103
- WHAT IN THE NAME OF NEPTUNE
IS GOING ON--WHOA!
- 以海王星的名义做什么
正在进行中——哇！

17:43.206 --> 17:44.827
[cash register rings]
[收银机铃声]

17:44.931 --> 17:48.137
- YAHOO, FREE MONEY!
- WOO-HOO, OH, FREE MONEY!
- 雅虎，免费的钱！
- 呜呼，哦，免费的钱！

17:48.241 --> 17:49.448
- THERE YOU ARE, SHINY.
- 你来了，闪亮的。

17:49.551 --> 17:51.137
- I'VE BEEN LOOKING
ALL OVER FOR YOU.
- 我一直在寻找
一切都为您服务。

17:51.241 --> 17:52.551
THANK GOODNESS YOU WEREN'T HURT.
谢天谢地，你没有受伤。

17:52.655 --> 17:53.758
- YOU BETTER GET HIM OUT OF HERE
- 你最好让他离开这里

17:53.862 --> 17:55.965
IF YOU WANT
TO KEEP HIM THAT WAY.
如果你愿意
让他保持这种状态。

17:56.068 --> 17:57.896
BUBBLES TODAY.
今天有泡沫。

17:58.000 --> 18:01.448
THEY DON'T SEEM TO UNDERSTAND
THE VALUE OF MONEY.
他们似乎不明白
金钱的价值。

18:01.551 --> 18:03.000
- THAT'S OKAY, SHINY.
- 没关系，闪亮的。

18:03.103 --> 18:06.068
IT'S TOO DANGEROUS FOR YOU TO
WORK AT THE KRUSTY KRAB, ANYWAY.
这对你来说太危险了
不管怎样，在蟹堡王工作吧。

18:06.172 --> 18:08.827
BUT THERE ARE A LOT OF FUN,
SAFE THINGS WE CAN DO.
但有很多乐趣，
我们可以做的安全事情。

18:08.931 --> 18:10.689
LIKE, STAND IN PLACE.
就像，站在原地。

18:10.793 --> 18:12.793
OR SIT IN PLACE.
或坐在原地。

18:12.896 --> 18:15.827
OR, UH...
LET'S NOT MOVE AT ALL GAME.
或者，呃...
游戏中我们不要动。

18:15.931 --> 18:17.655
PATRICK IS REALLY GOOD
AT THAT ONE. HE--
帕特里克真的很棒
在那一天。他 -

18:17.758 --> 18:20.103
SHINY?
SHINY, WHERE ARE YOU?
闪亮的？
闪亮，你在哪里？

18:20.206 --> 18:20.379
[gasp]
[喘气]

18:24.965 --> 18:27.379
AHH!
SHINY, NO!
啊啊！
闪亮，不！

18:27.482 --> 18:30.379
- NOT THE CITY.
IT'S TOO DANGEROUS.
- 不是城市。
这太危险了。

18:30.482 --> 18:32.793
SHINY, WHERE ARE YOU?
闪亮，你在哪里？

18:32.896 --> 18:33.862
[gasps]
[喘气]

18:39.241 --> 18:41.000
SHINY, NO!
闪亮，不！

18:44.724 --> 18:48.965
THERE NOW.
SAFE AND SOUND.
现在就在那里。
安全可靠。

18:49.068 --> 18:51.482
NOW, SHINY, I--
现在，闪亮的，我——

18:51.586 --> 18:55.344
NOW, SHINY,
YOU MIGHT--
现在，闪亮的，
你可能——

18:57.586 --> 19:00.413
THAT WAS A CLOSE ONE.
OKAY, SHINY.
那是一场势均力敌的比赛。
好的，闪亮的。

19:00.517 --> 19:01.724
LET'S GET YOU BACK
TO MY HOUSE,
让我们带你回来
到我家，

19:01.827 --> 19:04.448
AND KEEP YOU AWAY
FROM SHARP POINTY THINGS.
让你远离
来自尖锐的事物。

19:04.551 --> 19:06.275
OH, TARTAR SAUCE.
哦，鞑靼酱。

19:06.379 --> 19:08.758
[screams]
[尖叫声]

19:08.862 --> 19:10.379
[cars crashing]
[汽车相撞]

19:15.724 --> 19:17.655
"BIKINI BOTTOM PIN FACTORY?"
“比基尼底别针工厂？”

19:17.758 --> 19:20.206
SHINY, NO!
闪亮，不！

19:20.310 --> 19:21.655
I'LL SAVE YOU!
我会救你！

19:21.758 --> 19:25.586
[screams]
[尖叫声]

19:29.551 --> 19:30.655
YOU NEED TO WATCH
WHERE YOU'RE GOING.
你需要观看
你要去哪里。

19:30.758 --> 19:32.586
YOU COULD GET POPPED
IN A PLACE LIKE THAT.
你可能会被淘汰
在这样的地方。

19:32.689 --> 19:33.896
[gasps]
[喘气]

19:34.000 --> 19:35.448
HOLD ON, THERE'S SOMETHING
TICKLING MY NOSE.
等一下，有东西
挠我的鼻子。

19:46.379 --> 19:47.758
WHERE'S SHINY?
闪亮在哪里？

19:47.862 --> 19:52.344
OH, NO!
哦，不！

19:52.448 --> 19:53.448
"SCISSOR WORKS"?
“剪刀作品”？

19:53.551 --> 19:56.827
I'LL SAVE YOU, SHINY!
我会救你的，闪亮的！

19:56.931 --> 19:59.379
[scissors snipping]
[剪刀剪断]

19:59.482 --> 20:01.724
OH, BOY. DON'T YOU KNOW
SCISSORS ARE SHARP?
哦，男孩。你不知道吗
剪刀锋利吗？

20:01.827 --> 20:02.793
AND DANGEROUS?
有危险吗？

20:02.896 --> 20:05.862
LUCKILY,
WE BOTH ESCAPED UNHARMED.
幸运的是，
我们都毫发无伤地逃脱了。

20:13.793 --> 20:15.413
SHINY?
闪亮的？

20:19.413 --> 20:22.551
"PITCHFORK PANTRY."
OF COURSE.
“干草叉食品储藏室。”
当然。

20:22.655 --> 20:28.379
[metallic clang]
AH...OW.
[金属铿锵声]
啊……哦。

20:28.482 --> 20:30.482
SHINY, HOW MANY TIMES
DO I GOTTA TELL YA?
闪亮，多少次
我需要告诉你吗？

20:30.586 --> 20:33.482
NO SHARP. NO POINTY.
不锋利。没有意义。

20:33.586 --> 20:35.965
LET'S SEE IF THERE'S SOME PLACE
SAFE FOR YOU TO VISIT.
让我们看看是否有地方
您可以安全访问。

20:36.068 --> 20:36.827
AH. THAT'S IT.
啊。就是这样。

20:36.931 --> 20:39.413
THE PILLOW FOUNDRY.
枕头铸造厂。

20:39.517 --> 20:40.448
YOU'LL LIKE IT IN THERE.
你一定会喜欢那里的。

20:40.551 --> 20:41.931
PILLOWS AREN'T DANGEROUS.
枕头并不危险。

20:42.034 --> 20:42.965
HUH?
嗯？

20:43.068 --> 20:47.241
[machines pounding]
[机器轰鸣]

20:47.344 --> 20:50.724
[machines whirring]
[机器呼呼地响]

21:02.517 --> 21:03.793
OKAY, LET'S SKIP
THE PILLOW FOUNDRY.
好吧，我们跳过吧
枕头铸造厂。

21:03.896 --> 21:06.551
I'LL JUST TAKE YOU
TO MY HOUSE.
我就带你去
到我家。

21:06.655 --> 21:08.551
HERE WE ARE.
HOME SAFE HOME.
我们在这里。
安全回家。

21:08.655 --> 21:10.413
YOU MUST BE HUNGRY AFTER
ALL THAT RUNNING AROUND.
看完之后你一定很饿
到处乱跑的一切。

21:10.517 --> 21:14.241
NOW, WHAT WOULD
A GROWING BUBBLE EAT?
现在，会怎样
越来越多的泡泡餐？

21:14.344 --> 21:16.620
I KNOW!
我知道！

21:22.758 --> 21:23.896
SHINY!!
闪亮的！！

21:24.000 --> 21:25.827
DON'T WORRY, SHINY.
YOU'LL BE OKAY.
别担心，闪亮。
你会没事的。

21:25.931 --> 21:27.517
[grunts]
[咕哝]

21:30.068 --> 21:35.000
NO, THAT AIN'T RIGHT.
不，那是不对的。

21:35.103 --> 21:41.275
OH, COME ON, NOW.
哦，来吧，现在。

21:41.379 --> 21:44.586
AH.
HE'S OKAY.
啊。
他没事。

21:44.689 --> 21:45.689
UH-OH.
呃-哦。

21:45.793 --> 21:47.379
- HELLO THERE, SPONGEBOB.
- 你好，海绵宝宝。

21:47.482 --> 21:49.103
HOW'S MY LITTLE BOY BEEN FARING?
- [gulps]
我的小男孩过得怎么样？
- [吞咽]

21:49.206 --> 21:55.034
OH, WHAT, HO--SHINY?
HE'S, UH--BEEN BEHAVING GREAT.
哦，什么，嗬——闪亮的？
他，呃——表现得很好。

21:55.137 --> 21:56.413
- WELL, NOW.
- 好吧，现在。

21:56.517 --> 21:59.103
IT LOOKS LIKE YOU GONE AND GROWN
ANOTHER HEAD AGAIN, SHINY.
看起来你已经离开并长大了
又是一个头，闪闪发亮。

21:59.206 --> 22:01.620
- AGAIN?
- 再次？

22:01.724 --> 22:04.655
- NOT TO WORRY.
I'LL TAKE CARE OF IT.
- 不用担心。
我会处理的。

22:12.689 --> 22:14.344
- SO, SPONGEBOB.
- 那么，海绵宝宝。

22:14.448 --> 22:16.344
DID MY BOY SHINY
BEHAVE HIMSELF?
我的男孩闪亮吗
表现得好吗？

22:16.448 --> 22:19.551
- OH, HE WAS
JUST A LITTLE ANGEL.
- 哦，他是
只是一个小天使。

22:19.655 --> 22:21.655
IN A LITTLE DEVIL
SORT OF WAY.
《小恶魔》
有点像。

22:21.758 --> 22:26.517
- WELL, SO LONG, SPONGEBOB.
- 好啦，再见，海绵宝宝。

22:26.620 --> 22:29.482
THANKS FOR WATCHING MY BOY.
感谢您观看我的孩子。

22:29.586 --> 22:34.103
- [blows raspberry]
- [吹覆盆子]

22:34.206 --> 22:35.620
- SO LONG.
BYE BYE.
- 这么久。
再见。

22:35.724 --> 22:37.586
ANY TIME YOU NEED
A BABYSITTER,
任何您需要的时间
保姆，

22:37.689 --> 22:39.689
JUST GIVE ME
A LITTLE ADVANCE NOTICE.
只要给我
提前通知。

22:39.793 --> 22:41.793
I--UH,
I WORK A LOT.
我——呃，
我工作很多。

22:41.896 --> 22:43.862
I HAVE TO CHECK
WITH MR. KRABS AND...
我必须检查一下
与先生。螃蟹和...

22:43.965 --> 22:45.413
AND THERE'S GARY,
HE NEEDS FEEDING AND I...
还有加里，
他需要喂食，而我……

22:45.517 --> 22:49.517
STAND AROUND A LOT AND THAT
KEEPS ME BUSY.
多站在周围等等
让我忙碌。

多站在周围等等
让我忙碌。